	["{npc:14437} wants 10 Elixirs of Shadow Power ({skill:171}: 3 Ghost Mushrooms and a {item:8925} each), 6 Large Brilliant Shards ({skill:333}: disenchant level 51+ blue items), 25 {item:11370} ({skill:186} 230: the Dark Iron Deposits of the {zone:1428} and {area:1584}) and 35 Black Dragonscales ({skill:393}: the black dragonkin of the {zone:1428}, a few percent a kill, best from the {npc:7043}). Make or gather what your professions allow and buy the rest at the Auction House; it can take a while to find 35 scales."] = "{npc:14437} 需要10瓶暗影之力药剂（{skill:171}：每瓶需3个幽灵菇和一个 {item:8925}）、6块大块魔光碎片（{skill:333}：分解51级以上的蓝色物品）、25块 {item:11370}（{skill:186} 230：来自 {zone:1428} 和 {area:1584} 的黑铁矿脉），以及35片黑龙鳞片（{skill:393}：来自 {zone:1428} 的黑龙类，每只掉率为百分之几，最适合刷 {npc:7043}）。能用自己专业制作或采集的就自己解决，其余去拍卖行买；凑齐35片鳞片可能要花些时间。",
